le=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:15\\">18 years</strong> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:13\\">In operation</span> </div> </div> <p class=\\"codex-trust-note\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:31\\">Proud Tek is a Shenzhen-based RFID &amp; NFC manufacturing partner for hotels, laundries, events, retail and industrial programmes: we own the specification, chip sourcing and quality control, and tooling and production run on contracted partner lines to our spec. Certificate numbers and scope are published on <a href=\\"/about/certifications/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:376\\">the certifications page</a>; standard samples are free for qualified B2B buyers (DHL/FedEx freight at your cost, refunded against your first production order).</p> </section>"`;
